    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">This dialog shows an unsorted list of all predefined directory favorites. </text></para>
    <list id="0" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="&#167;" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">The order of the entries corresponds to the order of recording (this also applies to the order in the popup in the main window). </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">All entries in the &quot;Name&quot; column are displayed in the &quot;Favorites&quot; popup of the main windows as aliases for the assigned directories listed in the &quot;Value&quot; column. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">If a single favorite entry in the value column contains multiple directories, they are separated by a semicolon. </text></li>
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">Using the buttons in the right part of the dialog, new entries can be added, existing entries can be changed or deleted. </text></li>
    </list>
